lete knowledge of the network to optimize flow management and support user requirements. A custom network topology is created in our project and by using a centralized SDN controller, the network is controlled. After programming the network in tune with our application, packets are generated to test different applications that we developed on the SDN. This project demonstrates the different capabilities of SDN, by implementing 3 major network applications- SDN switch as a hub, SDN switch as a Firewall, and Selective Routing using SDN.","topics":[],"score":220576,"global_rank":209088},{"name":"vscerra/Bellabeat_Case_Study_In_R","owner":"vscerra","html_url":"https://github.com/vscerra/Bellabeat_Case_Study_In_R","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"This is a case study analysis completed for the Google Data Analytics certificate course on the Coursera platform","topics":[],"score":220575,"global_rank":209105},{"name":"skarukas/codepath-ios-tip-calculator","owner":"skarukas","html_url":"https://github.com/skarukas/codepath-ios-tip-calculator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":220575,"global_rank":209110},{"name":"KenjiCrosland/tavern-generator","owner":"KenjiCrosland","html_url":"https://github.com/KenjiCrosland/tavern-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Vue","description":"An app that generates random tavern descriptions for tabletop RPGs","topics":[],"score":220575,"global_rank":209112},{"name":"peakcm/polio_analyses","owner":"peakcm","html_url":"https://github.com/peakcm/polio_analyses","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":220575,"global_rank":209140},{"name":"1092772959/AppDocument","owner":"1092772959","html_url":"https://github.com/1092772959/AppDocument","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"TSQL","description":"\u6691\u671f\u8bfe\u7a0b\u5404\u7c7b\u62